00:20:29,710 --> 00:20:30,210
不行

248
00:20:30,790 --> 00:20:31,540
恕難從命

249
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:33,040
不行

250
00:20:38,630 --> 00:20:40,630
到目前為止的責任由我承擔

251
00:20:41,140 --> 00:20:42,390
你還有未來

252
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:44,290
不

253
00:20:44,470 --> 00:20:46,220
既然自覺已經死過一次

254
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:48,390
就帶著志同道合的人

255
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:49,810
到Archangel去

256
00:20:54,070 --> 00:20:56,570
這樣總有一天會找到道路

257
00:20:57,820 --> 00:20:58,820
戶高上校

258
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:00,150
拜託了

259
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:05,080
也為了我和今天枉死在這裡的將士

260
00:21:06,740 --> 00:21:07,330
快走

261
00:22:07,930 --> 00:22:14,950
I wanna go to a place where I can say

262
00:22:14,950 --> 00:22:20,060
That I'm all right and I'm staying there with you

263
00:22:23,010 --> 00:22:30,030
I wanna know if there could be anyway

264
00:22:30,030 --> 00:22:34,870
That there's no fight and I'm safe and sound with you

265
00:22:37,630 --> 00:22:43,660
And every time I look I thought you were there

266
00:22:43,660 --> 00:22:47,870
But it was just my imaginaion

267
00:22:47,870 --> 00:22:50,640
I don't see it anymore

268
00:22:50,640 --> 00:22:58,810
Cause I see through you now

269
00:22:58,810 --> 00:23:03,140
What's stopping me? I get stuck again

270
00:23:03,140 --> 00:23:08,890
Is it really OK? It's never OK for me

271
00:23:08,890 --> 00:23:13,140
What's got into me? I get lost again

272
00:23:13,140 --> 00:23:20,180
Is it really OK? It's never going to be

273
00:23:24,630 --> 00:23:28,790
為何  這是重複過無數次的言語

274
00:23:29,630 --> 00:23:33,790
為何  即使如此詢問也沒有任何回應

275
00:23:34,630 --> 00:23:37,790
那麼  現在蠢動的這個生命是…

276
00:23:38,150 --> 00:23:42,450
同伴們悲傷的幻影向狄蘭達爾述說著什麼

277
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:46,530
下集  機動戰士鋼彈 SEED DESTINY

278
00:23:46,530 --> 00:23:47,730
FATES

279
00:23:48,450 --> 00:23:51,870
向新的世界飛去 GUNDAM

